@startuml getResponseProfile
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getResponseProfile – Retrieve ResponseProfile
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ResponseProfile" as rp #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
   UUID of the ResponseProfile
end note

requestor -> rp: (profileUuid)
activate rp

rp -> jd: access profile-collection
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> rp: Profile-list
deactivate jd

note over rp
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Extract profile list  
  - Identify ResponseProfile entries  
  - Match profileUuid  
  - Prepare ResponseProfile object  
  - Return undefined if not found
end note

rp --> requestor: ResponseProfile | undefined
deactivate rp

@enduml
